  "content": "<article class=\"gv-story gv-photo-video\"><header class=\"gv-intro\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Brooklyn, New York · Wedding photography &amp; film</p><h1>Alexandria &amp; James · Selena &amp; Dashmir<br><em>Giando on the Water</em></h1><p class=\"gv-lede\">Two weddings at Giando on the Water, presented as separate GioLina films.</p><nav class=\"gv-story-nav\" aria-label=\"Explore this wedding\"><a href=\"#wedding-film\">The film</a><a href=\"#wedding-photographs\">The photographs</a></nav></header><section id=\"wedding-film\" class=\"gv-film-section\" aria-label=\"Alexandria &amp; James wedding film\"><div class=\"gv-film-heading\"><h2>Alexandria &amp; James</h2></div><div class=\"gl-film-preview gv-film\" style=\"aspect-ratio:442/180\"><img src=\"/assets/alexandria-james.png\" width=\"442\" height=\"180\" alt=\"Alexandria &amp; James, a still from the GioLina wedding film\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"><button type=\"button\" data-mediazilla-src=\"https://mediazilla.com/fAkBCNBFRB\" data-film-title=\"Alexandria &amp; James\" aria-label=\"Play wedding film, Alexandria &amp; James\"><span>Play wedding film</span></button></div><p class=\"gv-caption\">Alexandria &amp; James · A film by GioLina Films</p><p class=\"gv-caption\">Cinematography by GioLina Films.</p></section><section id=\"wedding-film-2\" class=\"gv-film-section\" aria-label=\"Selena &amp; Dashmir wedding film\"><div class=\"gv-film-heading\"><h2>Selena &amp; Dashmir</h2></div><div class=\"gl-film-preview gv-film\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1315/510\"><img src=\"/assets/seleena-dashmir-poster.jpg\" width=\"1315\" height=\"510\" alt=\"Selena &amp; Dashmir, a still from the GioLina wedding film\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"842690557\" data-film-title=\"Selena &amp; Dashmir\" aria-label=\"Play wedding film, Selena &amp; Dashmir\"><span>Play wedding film</span></button></div><p class=\"gv-caption\">Selena &amp; Dashmir · A film by GioL