0px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/853\" alt=\"Megan and Ralph beside the waterfront railing with Manhattan behind them\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-46337fd10ea72807.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Ralph kissing Megan on the cheek beside the waterfront\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-46337fd10ea72807-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-46337fd10ea72807-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-46337fd10ea72807.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/853\" alt=\"Ralph kissing Megan on the cheek beside the waterfront\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-013100c3807952f3.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Megan and Ralph holding hands in a waterfront portrait\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-013100c3807952f3-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-013100c3807952f3-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-013100c3807952f3.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/853\" alt=\"Megan and Ralph holding hands in a waterfront portrait\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-4a0d3cfdb0f37e37.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Megan and Ralph walking away along a brick path\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-4a0d3cfdb0f37e37-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-4a0d3cfdb0f37e37-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-4a0d3cfdb0f37e37.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/853\" alt=\"Megan and Ralph walking away along a brick path\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-b1152247c833e151.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link a